[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Tech"]
layout_mode = 2
text = "You can teach your charges some new technology.
If you enable the technology, they will spend resources over time, up to 10% of their amount per year, on this technology. If all resources are paid, they will attempt to learn it.
 However, your success is not certain. If learning the technology fails, its costs are doubled, and its success chance increases by its base success chance.
The increase in success chance remains through prestiges. The increase in cost does not."

